Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.94,0:02:16.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Today is the day I will definitely, absolutely tell Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.53,0:02:19.86,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can say what I want...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.28,0:02:24.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...but it feels like I'm just going to end up chickening out again.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.16,0:02:30.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That's it. If I don't tell her today, \NI am going to shave my head.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.29,0:02:31.54,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No going back.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.75,0:02:34.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's Murao-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.71,0:02:37.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's invite Murao-san, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.84,0:02:39.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.47,0:02:40.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.68,0:02:44.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me I have to say it in front of her too?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.27,0:02:50.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I already decided to shave my head if I didn't tell her today...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.56,0:02:54.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If I can't today, I don't think I ever will.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.94,0:02:59.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So you're seriously hanging out with Makita Yuuri now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.45,0:03:01.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Asumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.12,0:03:05.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.12,0:03:09.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,L-Listen to this! The donut shop by the station is having a 100-yen sale!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.66,0:03:11.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wanna check it out?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.21,0:03:11.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.96,0:03:14.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You, me, and Futaba-chan. The three of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.63,0:03:16.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.09,0:03:22.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry I asked out of nowhere. \NI'm sure you're busy.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I should've figured.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.97,0:03:28.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'm free.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.85,0:03:33.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You really have changed.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.52,0:03:36.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.94,0:03:40.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's what I've been trying to do.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.07,0:03:44.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll take those words as a compliment.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.99,0:03:47.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.25,0:03:51.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I focused on trying not to be hated
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.08,0:03:54.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,and couldn't express my true feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.75,0:03:57.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,We were just pretending to be friends
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.09,0:03:59.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,and Kou called me out on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.68,0:04:07.01,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm different now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.51,0:04:10.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I managed to change.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.81,0:04:12.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.15,0:04:17.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,With Yuuri, I'm not pretending.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.11,0:04:19.94,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Murao-san agreed to come! Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.48,0:04:19.94,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She's a truly precious friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.74,0:04:25.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,And it's because she's so precious to me that I want to be honest with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.45,0:04:32.79,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.79,0:04:36.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Look! Mabuchi-kun lent it to me today!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.54,0:04:37.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm so lucky!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.75,0:04:41.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can't find the right timing to tell her!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.22,0:04:45.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Say it or shave my head.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.01,0:04:50.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But I'm scared! I'm so scared to speak up!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.77,0:04:53.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuu—
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.48,0:04:56.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? {this is Aikatsu Yuu's VA}{kuu aikatsu yuu sa?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.36,0:05:03.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,My heart feels like it's going to shatter.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.03,0:05:07.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.91,0:05:09.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.12,0:05:16.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's... something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.75,0:05:19.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.84,0:05:27.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.01,0:05:32.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...I also like him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.47,0:05:35.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I like Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.06,0:05:42.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I fell in love with the boy you liked.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.28,0:05:44.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.32,0:05:51.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You too, Futaba-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.74,0:05:57.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's so cool and handsome, isn't he?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.21,0:05:59.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think you two need glasses.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.92,0:06:02.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What? He totally is!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.96,0:06:02.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.42,0:06:05.80,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,What don't you like about Mabuchi-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.21,0:06:07.01,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Was this even a possibility?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.80,0:06:07.88,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,He acts like a spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.34,0:06:11.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd just said it sooner.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.89,0:06:13.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, but now...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.89,0:06:19.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan, you and Mabuchi-kun are already really close, so I've got no chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.06,0:06:21.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're wrong! We're not!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.65,0:06:26.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou already told me he doesn't like me that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.03,0:06:29.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? Futaba-chan, you've already confessed to him?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.61,0:06:32.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,N-No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.07,0:06:37.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just, I recently found out that we actually both liked each other back in middle school.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.33,0:06:46.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But when we met again, he straight up\Ntold me that it was all in the past.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.71,0:06:48.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I see. {sometimes I consider putting "I didn't know" or "I never knew" here, but it's just like "well no shit, I just told you"}{ton sansesa}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.43,0:06:56.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,At first, I felt the same way. \NThat I didn't like who he'd become.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Alright then.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.61,0:07:07.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,From here on out, no getting angry no matter who wins.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.95,0:07:17.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm going to the bathroom for a bit. {how the hell do girls phrase this, and why is Japan so crass?}{was sagst du?}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.01,0:07:31.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was so scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.81,0:07:37.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.35,0:07:40.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I knew I had to tell her,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.56,0:07:44.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't get the words out.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's finally over.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.87,0:07:59.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan likes Mabuchi-kun too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.75,0:08:08.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We both love the same person.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.55,0:08:15.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It must've been so hard for her to tell me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.15,0:08:29.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,We can both love him, and whoever wins, wins.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.91,0:08:45.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.79,0:08:52.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri... her eyes are red.{ah, the French problem... (I'd say "Yuuri...'s eyes are red" in speech, but you can't write that)}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.59,0:08:52.26,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,My juice is all gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.13,0:08:54.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She must have gone to the bathroom...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.84,0:08:57.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...to cry.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.43,0:09:02.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.68,0:09:04.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...am also in love.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.31,0:09:06.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,With Tanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.48,0:09:09.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?! Where did that even come from?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.57,0:09:13.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? You don't seem all that surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.61,0:09:16.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did you already know?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.95,0:09:19.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.99,0:09:22.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I didn't want anyone to know,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.16,0:09:25.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but she happened to find out.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.66,0:09:30.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if she had told you already,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.88,0:09:39.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but it looks like she kept her word and stayed silent.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.14,0:09:45.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita-san's a good girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.69,0:09:53.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You knew that too. That's why you strained yourself to come clean.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.95,0:10:06.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,After looking at you two, I thought it might be okay to tell you about my feelings.{sie ist nicht ein 'alright' maedchen}{yes you can use alright like that}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.12,0:10:08.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's where it came from.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.29,0:10:12.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.71,0:10:18.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,this is the first time I've gone somewhere after school with friends since I entered high school.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.26,0:10:21.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.31,0:10:27.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It'll all come down to Mabuchi's decision, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.85,0:10:32.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's no point in fighting each other over him.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.73,0:10:36.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You could both lose, for all we know.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.11,0:10:40.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Very true.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.74,0:10:44.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But even if one of you succeeds,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.74,0:10:48.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll still be on both of your sides.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good luck, you two.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.79,0:10:54.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.38,0:10:55.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.84,0:10:59.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That said, you two have some terrible taste.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.40,0:11:17.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.86,0:11:24.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I heard you weren't coming to our after-finals karaoke party.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.28,0:11:28.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You haven't gone to a single class gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:29.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Can't you show your face for once?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.29,0:11:33.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like going.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.00,0:11:35.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have any attachment to the class anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.30,0:11:37.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.09,0:11:42.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business, Kominato-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.20,0:12:07.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The sky's already pitch-black.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.20,0:12:10.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Girls talk is serious stuff.{why does it have to be a spinny thing}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.16,0:12:13.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I told her everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Now I can get close to Kou. {without guilt}{I must've distracted you with that because you missed the nao nao}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.13,0:12:23.22,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.93,0:12:27.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why are you here now, of all times?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.10,0:12:30.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready yet...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.85,0:12:32.73,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.11,0:12:38.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.65,0:12:42.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the same cat we saw before.{That's Terry Bradshaw's jersey, for the record}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.11,0:12:45.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think he's gotten used to this place.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.95,0:12:49.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But doesn't he seem thinner?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.49,0:12:52.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hope he's getting enough to eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.96,0:12:55.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why not adopt him if you're so worried?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.50,0:12:59.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't. I'll start to get attached if I take him home.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.67,0:13:03.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's so wrong with that?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.63,0:13:08.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The more things you view as precious,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.80,0:13:10.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,the more they weigh you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.44,0:13:16.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.35,0:13:18.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're getting on a train?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.61,0:13:21.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where are you going this late at night?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.28,0:13:22.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's my secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.57,0:13:33.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The more things you view as precious, the more they weigh you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.08,0:13:38.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What about school and friends?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Does Kou not hold them precious?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.26,0:13:46.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Hearing him say something like that,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.18,0:13:50.30,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I can't help but worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.23,0:14:09.37,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,So here I am following him, but where's he going?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.79,0:14:19.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He got off!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.32,0:14:51.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, a high school girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She's pretty cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.91,0:15:00.12,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up with this place?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's full of young people.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.59,0:15:04.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.96,0:15:05.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sup.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.51,0:15:12.22,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's Kou... is he friends with those guys?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.76,0:15:15.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I wonder why... it's like...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.01,0:15:18.85,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou is in a completely different world.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.39,0:15:20.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.86,0:15:27.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.53,0:15:30.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's what I want to ask you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.28,0:15:34.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from, and why are you angry?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.74,0:15:37.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Because, uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.17,0:15:44.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's almost time for midterms! \NShouldn't you be studying?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.38,0:15:50.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou-kun, you can't let your brain go to waste like that. {too, uh, clever?}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.63,0:15:52.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Your girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.72,0:15:53.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hell no.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.89,0:15:56.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mind if I hit on her then?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.89,0:15:58.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She's spot-on my type.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.23,0:16:04.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She's crude and ill-mannered, eats more\N\N than I do, and has huge feet to boot. {apparently a thing. more than 70% of cases amongst women is due to water weight}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.31,0:16:06.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you can even call her a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.94,0:16:08.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.15,0:16:11.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'd say she's quite the girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey there, baby.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.86,0:16:15.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.03,0:16:18.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I bet she's really packing. {Hers look pretty big to me}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.79,0:16:20.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You with anyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.29,0:16:21.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.66,0:16:23.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Her tits.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.21,0:16:32.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hearing someone say that about my friend
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.67,0:16:34.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,really pisses me off. {gross}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.05,0:16:38.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm out for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:17:01.62,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kudarizaka fumikiri made
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:17:01.62,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Before I knew it, I had run
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:06.63,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}atashi wa muchuu de hashitta
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:06.63,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}all the way down to the train tracks.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.29,0:17:06.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Go right here and you'll eventually\N reach the train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:12.30,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kono koi wo saegiru you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:12.30,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}What I found was a train departing,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.29,0:17:09.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What about you? Aren't you going home?{back can mean "back there"}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:17.18,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}densha wa sugisatta
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:17.18,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}taking my love with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:22.85,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}tooi hi no kioku  umi no kagayaki
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:22.85,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Distant memories, shining seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.73,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kisetsu wa meguru
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:25.73,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Seasons pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:30.11,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}hikoukigumo ni me wo hosomete
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:30.11,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Now, I squint up at the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:35.49,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}chiisaku yureta himawari
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:35.49,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}A sunflower swayed in the breeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:41.87,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}sayonara mo ienai mata
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:41.87,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}seeing how I couldn't even say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:51.71,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}hon no suumiri no sukima de sotto kusuguru itami
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:51.71,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}We were so tantalizingly close, yet so far apart.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.83,0:17:48.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Stop following me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:57.26,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}manatsu ni kieta hanabi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:57.26,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}If only the summer fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:18:03.18,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}namida no saki ni utsureba
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:18:03.18,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}had appeared before my tears...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.34,0:18:02.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm too frustrated to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:08.60,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will kitto omoidasu wa
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:08.60,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will definitely remember.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.02,0:18:11.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm frustrated that it feels like I haven't gotten closer to you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:20.37,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}anata ni todoke kono basho de atashi wa matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:20.37,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Please know that I'll be here, waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.35,0:18:45.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What are those guys like?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.77,0:18:48.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No idea. Don't know them much.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.23,0:18:51.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do you go there often? Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.69,0:18:54.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not a bad place to kill time.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.49,0:19:02.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you doing something bad?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.12,0:19:06.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Like drinking or smoking?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.37,0:19:13.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I guess some of them do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But I don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.84,0:19:21.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't really have any desire to.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.59,0:19:24.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just go to talk.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.77,0:19:34.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you want someone to talk with, then I'm right here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.44,0:19:41.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A-And Kominato-kun and Yuuri are, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.53,0:19:43.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You've got plenty of options.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.66,0:19:48.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Besides, aren't you just pretending\N to be friends with them?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.29,0:19:49.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Eat your words!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.13,0:19:54.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.42,0:19:58.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a bit too defenseless? \NI could just assault you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.51,0:20:02.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.59,0:20:07.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know you don't see me like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.60,0:20:11.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And I know you'd never do something like that,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.85,0:20:12.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,so it's fine—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.15,0:20:20.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.61,0:20:22.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can't even put up a fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.12,0:20:26.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Any guy,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.83,0:20:29.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,even if he thinks nothing of her,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.00,0:20:31.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,could assault a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.92,0:20:42.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.88,0:20:45.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See? Scary, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.93,0:20:47.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A flick?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.64,0:20:50.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The only reason you didn't just get assaulted
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.39,0:20:53.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,was because it happened to be me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.56,0:21:00.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to be scared like that again, don't go to a place like that alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.15,0:21:07.95,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Did he do that just to prove a point?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.96,0:21:16.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you crying?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.46,0:21:22.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry... I guess I went a bit far.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.42,0:21:27.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I really was surprised. Scared, even.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.89,0:21:32.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But those aren't the only reasons for my tears.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.77,0:21:34.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.94,0:21:40.61,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,More than that, I'm just ashamed
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.73,0:21:43.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,at how excited it made me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.36,0:21:48.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,However...
